BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:El Grupo de Apoyo Latino
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T170000
DTSTAMP:20261016T113307Z
UID:dothebay-16869109@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:El Grupo de Apoyo Latino de SFAF es un grupo social y educativ
 o que ofrece un espacio abierto\, seguro\, y confidencial para apoyar a la
  comunidad Latina afectada por el VIH y SIDA. Es un grupo diverso\, donde 
 el respeto es la base para que todos los asistentes puedan expresar librem
 ente sus experiencias\, identidad\, étnicidad\, nacionalidad\, sexualidad
 \, y creencias religiosas.\n\nTodas las reuniones son en español y se lle
 van a cabo en un ambiente positivo\, familiar\, y confidencial. Ven a comp
 artir con nosotros\, estamos seguros que encontrarás apoyo y recibirás i
 nformación para mejorar tu calidad de vida.\n\nSFAF ofrece servicios a cu
 alquier persona sin importar su situación migratoria.\n\nPara mas informa
 ción sobre El Grupo\, llama al 415-632-9722.\n\n_____\n\nOur support grou
 p\, El Grupo\, has been a stable source of family and community for Latino
 s\, Latinas and their families since the early 1980s. Join us for informat
 ion about sexual health and harm reduction\, meals and social support\, an
 d help finding health and social services.\n\nMeetings are in-person at 94
 0 Howard St Group Room A every Thursday from 3 to 5 pm.\n\nDetails: https:
 //dothebay.com/events/2026/10/15/el-grupo-de-apoyo-latino-tickets\nSource:
  DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/29788693/8d841f64-bcb5-4750-9cd5-d087518399f1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261016T113307Z
LOCATION:San Francisco AIDS Foundation\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/15/el-grupo-de-apoyo-latino-ticket
 s
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Crossing 5th Year Anniversary Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T180000
DTSTAMP:20261016T113307Z
UID:dothebay-17916764@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:5
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:The East Cut Presents\nThe Crossing 5th Year Anniversary Celeb
 ration\nThursday\, October 15 | The Crossing at East Cut\n\nWe're celebrat
 ing five years of The Crossing and 10 years of The East Cut! It's been a w
 ild ride\, and we're so excited to celebrate five years of bringing our do
 wntown community together. There's no better feeling!\n\nJoin us on Thursd
 ay\, October 15th\, from 4 to 7 PM to celebrate all things Crossing. We'll
  have a live DJ\, bar specials\, a pop-up shop from Ruby's Old & New\, liv
