DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJames HawkinsAnother year has 
 passed and anniversary time is upon us again! Thursday\, October 15th we w
 ill be celebrating NINETEEN YEARS of Shelter SF Drum & Bass!!! As the long
 est (currently) running drum & bass + jungle night in San Francisco\, we
 ’re excited and pleased to celebrate yet another year of doing our part 
 to help keep this music pumping in the San Francisco Bay Area! Just as wit
 h prior years\, we’re grateful to be able to play the music we love\, an
 d appreciate to the community – new and old – for their continued supp
 ort. We are also pleased to be a place to regularly host local and up-and-
 coming drum & bass and jungle DJs\, as the importance of maintaining the l
 ifeblood of the community cannot be overstated enough.\nIn addition to all
  that\, we’re also celebrating that we are able to keep the vibes + tune
 s flowing at our amazing home venue Underground SF! Formerly known as The 
 Top\, this location – at 424 Haight street – has been host to multiple
  dnb + jungle nights for over a quarter century. Shelter began back in 200
 7\, with our immediate predecessor\, Phuturo\, running for years before Sh
 elter (and Phunckateck even before that!) We are fortunate to have a diver
 se crew\, whose memberships spans the lifetime of Shelter (with some even 
 preceding it!) and all bring different skills\, styles and their own uniqu
 e tastes and talents together to contribute to the night as a whole. And m
 assive appreciation goes out to the Underground SF crew who’v...\n\nFree
 \n\nTickets: https://ra.co/events/2552729\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.co
 m/sheltersf-dnb-19year-anniversary/\nSource: Funcheap SF
