BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:UNDSCVRD Golden Hour Night Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T180000
DTSTAMP:20261017T105245Z
UID:dothebay-17950773@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:For its tenth anniversary\, UNDISCOVERED SF is bringing the ni
 ght market vibes back for the first time since the pandemic. In partnershi
 p with Victory Hall\, formerly known as the iconic nightclub 330 Ritch\, t
 his year's themes "Golden Hour" and "Made With Mahal\," make an intimate b
 ut electric return. With DJ sets by Hoochi\, Vieux Carre\, Boogie Brown\, 
 and performance by The Top Chefs of Live on The Stoop. Then step inside Vi
 ctory Hall for a special exhibition honoring the history of 330 Ritch\, th
 e legendary nightclub that once made this block pulse after dark. The even
 t is FREE for all ages and will take place Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\, 
 from 4-10 PM\, on Ritch Street between Townsend and Brannan. The tenth ann
 iversary edition returns the market's roots to SoMa nightlife history\, pa
 iring that legacy with a new generation of vendors\, chefs\, and makers wh
 o have built their businesses through UNDSCVRD SF. This year's curated ven
 dors include food vendors-Mestiza\, Little Skillet\, Senor Sisig\, Cafe 86
 \, Ube Area\, and more. Retailers include Malaya Botanicals\, Mie Makes\, 
