DESCRIPTION:Photos by @jordanplumbcreative\n\nBad Art Club is where you go
  to unblock creativity\, be in community and play like a kid again. Come b
 e yourself & do your worst with us!\n\nHere’s the thing about masks: You
  gotta put em’ on to pull em’ off!\nCome be totally surprised by the m
 ask you make and see what happens to you when you put it on (and pull it o
 ff).\n\nWith a bunch of unexpected materials at your fingertips\, you’ll
  make a mask as ridiculous as you can possibly imagine.\nReal people\, rea
 l connection\, guaranteed.\nBad Art Club is the art class you wish you had
  as a kid. It’s where you go to wake up your creativity\, connect with g
 enuine people and have yourself a good laugh.\nFirst time? You’re in for
  a treat. Leave your expectations at the door and come exactly as you are.
 \nImportant Info:\n– All supplies are provided\n– Arrive on time at 6p
 m (no entry will be permitted past 6:30pm)\n– BAC is a sober event\nWe c
 an’t wait to get messy with you!\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://www.event
 brite.com/e/the-bad-art-mask-querade-tickets-2002831538045\nDetails: https
 ://sf.funcheap.com/bad-art-maskquerade-ridiculous-mask-faight-sf/\nSource:
  Funcheap SF
