BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Palestinian Folk Dance + Mutual Aid Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T210000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:funcheap-1641189@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMama GanuushSticking Together 
 and Fighting Back: A Workshop with Dean Spade\nCo-hosted by Mama Ganuush &
  King LOTUS BOY | Performances by ZAK\, Shams w/ Dabka Drag and Drums\n\nS
 AN FRANCISCO\, CA – Organizer and author Dean Spade as a guest at Salon 
 HALA will lead “Sticking Together and Fighting Back\,” a workshop on m
 utual aid and collective resistance\, on Monday\, October 26\, 2026\, 6–
 9 PM at The Lab (2948 16th St.\, San Francisco\, CA 94103).\nThe evening i
 s co-hosted by Mama Ganuush and King LOTUS BOY.\nMama Ganuush (they/them) 
 is a trans Palestinian performance artist\, filmmaker\, and organizer base
 d in San Francisco. They are the founder of the Heritage Activists and Lib
 eration Artists (HALA) Collective\, a radically queer collaboration of art
 ists dedicated to Palestinian liberation and all people fighting coloniali
 sm. HALA produces Salon HALA\, a queer art salon in the spirit of the Pari
 sian art salons of the past-an immersive\, celebratory event that blends l
 ive performances\, community recognition\, and interactive games to uplift
  queer voices and engage in radical joy through art\, music\, and movement
 . Salon HALA benefits the Bay to Gaza Mutual Aid Collective\, with proceed
 s directly supporting healthcare and education initiatives in Palestine. M
 ama Ganuush’s work weaves Palestinian folk art\, Egyptian golden-era dan
 ce\, and theatrical clowning into a vision of queer Palestinian liberation
 .\nKing LOTUS BOY is a shapeshifting\, transgender and nonbinary\, unap...
 \n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/thesalonhala\nDetails: http
 s://sf.funcheap.com/free-palestinian-folk-dance-mutual-aid-workshop-sf/\nS
 ource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T210655Z
LOCATION:The Lab\, 2948 16th St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-palestinian-folk-dance-mutual-aid-worksho
 p-sf/
END:VEVENT
