UID:dothebay-17905397@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:CrawlSF Presents\nThe Official San Francisco Halloween Pub Cra
 wl\nFriday\, October 30 | Mayes Oyster House\n\nThere is a particular elec
 tricity that only San Francisco can conjure on the Friday before Halloween
 —when the city itself seems to lean into the night with a conspiratorial
  grin. On October 30 the San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl returns for its
  second day of a four-day odyssey that began October 24 and will crest thr
 ough October 31 and November 1. This is the evening when costumes grow bol
 der\, laughter grows louder\, and the streets between Polk and the surroun
 ding neighborhoods become a moving stage of pure seasonal joy.\n\nArrive a
 t Mayes Oyster House by 6 PM and feel the collective anticipation rise lik
 e fog off the bay. Your ticket unlocks free entry to an exclusive circuit 
 of the city’s most charismatic bars: the romantic flicker of Beso Mae\, 
 the storybook quirk of White Rabbit\, the sleek confidence of Silver Cloud
 \, the vibrant pulse of Hanaro\, the cool radiance of The Blue Light\, the
  social swirl of Jaxson\, the high-energy floor of Decodance\, the musical
  heartbeat of Music City Starfactory\, the flavorful spirit of Sacred Taco
 \, the stellar vibe of Comet Club\, the friendly clink of glasses at Union
  Street Ale House\, the adventure-ready atmosphere of Route 101\, the styl
 ish allure of El Lopo\, the playful dual personality of Rick & Roxy’s\, 
 the timeless charm of Rockwell\, the storied character of McTeague’s Sal
 oon\, the contemporary cool of Westwood\, the plush refuge of Lush...\n\n$
 12 - $45\, 21+\nCrawlSF Presents\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5
 J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fthe-official-san-francisco-hall
 oween-pub-crawl-tickets-1983732312748\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/event
 s/2026/10/30/the-official-san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl\nSource: DoThe
 Bay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-epic-halloween-pub-c
 rawl-crawloween-2026-oct-24-nov-1-2/
