 k at The Kink Store in the heart of San Francisco.Blacklights.\n\nBright r
 ope. Delicious tension.\n\nKick off Halloween weekend at The Kink Store\, 
 where neon lights catch every curve and the night is yours to explore.\nCo
 me for the rope\, linger for the chemistry\, and follow your curiosity int
 o a night of bondage\, play\, and connection.\n\nSee\, be seen\, and scene
 ! Tie someone who catches your eye\, surrender to a trusted partner's rope
 s\, or settle in and enjoy the show. Every invitation starts with consent.
  Where the evening goes is yours to negotiate.\n\nThroughout the space\, y
 ou'll find:\nRoom to get tangled: a rope-forward play space with dedicated
  suspension points.\nA little hands-on color: interactive neon body paint.
 \nA soundtrack for the night: a DJ and high-energy music.\nA glow worth dr
 essing for: blacklights\, neon\, and UV-reactive details.\nWays to break t
 he tension: icebreakers and interactive activities for meeting new people.
 \nSpace to get comfortable: cozy spots for getting horizontal and play equ
 ipment throughout the dungeon.\nStart the night hands-on\n\nFrom 8–9 pm\
 , Twisted Windows leads an interactive activity to get you playing\, glowi
 ng\, and connecting. Join in or enjoy watching as the evening warms up.\n\
 nAt 9 pm\, the lights go down\, the blacklights come up\, and open play co
 ntinues until 12am.\nNeon\, UV-reactive looks\, and Halloween attire are e
 nthusiastically encouraged\, never required. Wear something that begs to b
 e...\n\n$39.84 to $74.49\nKink.com & Twisted Windows\n\nTickets: https://c
