DESCRIPTION:CrawlSF Presents\nSan Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl: Crawlowee
 n\nSaturday\, October 31 | Mayes Oyster House\n\nBy midafternoon on Hallow
 een\, San Francisco will already be filling with superheroes\, movie chara
 cters\, monsters and groups dressed in matching costumes. Many of them wil
 l be heading to Crawloween\, the massive San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl
  taking place from 2PM to 10PM on Saturday\, October 31\, 2026. More than 
 20\,000 participants are expected to join the main day of this four-part H
 alloween event.\n\nCrawloween is built for people who want choices. The ro
 ute includes more than 50 bars spread through the Marina\, Russian Hill\, 
 Polk Gulch\, Union Square and other parts of the city. Participants are no
 t locked into one venue or one schedule. After checking in\, they can choo
 se their own stops\, meet up with friends in different neighborhoods and s
 pend the day moving between casual bars\, dance venues\, restaurants and H
 alloween-themed locations.\n\nThe long event schedule makes it possible to
  start early and enjoy the celebration at a comfortable pace. Guests can a
 rrive in the afternoon\, visit a few bars\, stop for food and then head to
 ward the busiest parts of the route as Halloween night gets underway. Disc
 ounted drink specials at participating locations can help make a long day 
 out more affordable\, while free entry at crawl bars means groups can keep
  moving without paying separate cover charges at every stop.\n\nTransporta
 tion between event areas is easier thanks to the free Pub Cr...\n\n$12 - $
 55\, 21+\nCrawlSF Presents\n\nTickets: https://crawlsf.com/events/crawlowe
 en-san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl-2/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/eve
 nts/2026/10/31/san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl-crawloween-tickets\nSourc
 e: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-epic-25000-h
 alloween-pub-crawl-is-back-crawloween-2026/
