DESCRIPTION:Disco never left. Neither did great wine. VOON 54: Studio 54 g
 lamour meets harvest season\, one unforgettable night at W San Francisco.\
 n\nVOON 54:\nA Studio 54 Harvest Party with VOON Wines\nStep into the disc
 o. VOON Wines invites you to VOON 54\, a night of glitter\, groove\, and g
 reat wine\, celebrating this year's harvest in true Studio 54 fashion.\n\n
 Hosted in partnership with W San Francisco\, VOON 54 brings together our c
 ommunity for an evening of dancing\, DJ sets\, live music\, and pours from
  our latest harvest. Expect velvet disco vibes a dance floor that doesn't 
 quit\, all wrapped in the glamour of one of the most iconic nightlife eras
 .\n\nWines by VOON Wines (@voonwines)\n\nDJing by DJ Maximilian and DJ Que
 sty!\n\nLive performances by Bay Area favorites Analog Dog\, Cardboard Peo
 ple\, and Hugo de la Lune!\n\nCome dressed to dazzle. Sequins\, silk\, gol
 d\, and glam are all welcome (and encouraged).\n\nSaturday\, November 7th\
 n7:00 PM – 11:00 PM (The Living Room bar at W will be open after)\nW San
  Francisco — 181 3rd Street\, SOMA\n$18 per ticket (entry only — wine 
 available for purchase on-site)\n21+ event\, valid ID required\nFeaturing 
 VOON Wines' latest harvest\nLive music + DJs all night\nStudio 54 dress co
 de encouraged\nVIP guest room rates at W San Francisco for those staying t
 he night\nJoin us to toast the season\, the community\, and the vines that
  made it all possible.\nGrab your tickets now — VOON 54 will sell out.\n
 \nLearn more about VOON Wines (@voonwines on Instagram) and order your new
  favorites at...\n\n$18 Entry\, Ages 21+\nVOON Wines\n\nTickets: https://c
 onsumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fvoon-54-a-s
 tudio-54-harvest-party-with-voon-wines-tickets-2000671836319\nDetails: htt
