DESCRIPTION:Hello Pervy Players!\n\nPlayXLand is a BDSM/Kink/Fetish night 
 hosted by Cat Club in partnership with the Leather Alliance in San Francis
 co.\n\n——\n\nGo-Go's live and onstage! Don't forget to bring your tip 
 money\n\nOne of a kind dungeon featuring guest hosts and performances\, as
  well as furniture and suspension hooks\, and toys that you are more than 
 welcome to play with!\n\n——\n\n9pm-2am\n\n$10 in Fetishwear / $20 in S
 treet Clothes\n\n——\n\nTHE CAT CLUB\n\n1190 Folsom\, SF 21+\n\n(wednes
 days)\n\n(more info)\n\nNO PHOTOS - No photos are allowed to be taken insi
 de the club during this event. No photos may be taken of patrons at any ti
 me without consent.\n\nNO TOUCHING WITHOUT CONSENT - This is a general rul
 e for all events at Cat Club and this event is no exception. DO NOT TOUCH 
 ANY INDIVIDUAL WITHOUT OBTAINING CONSENT. Consent means an ENTHUSIASTIC YE
