BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Paranda Party 3: Jeeti Raho
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17908928@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:Paranda Party is a queer South Asian cultural celebration buil
 t around the paranda\, a punjabi hair tassel that is braided into the hair
 . Now in its third year\, this is a night where South Asian culture and qu
 eerness share the same room.\n\nThis year's theme\, Jeeti Raho\, takes its
  name from the blessings our elders give us: jeeti raho\, khush raho\, aba
 d raho. Stay living\, stay happy\, stay prosperous. Many of us grew up hea
 ring body-shaming comments in the place those blessings should have been. 
 Jeeti Raho reclaims them\, on our own terms.\n\nJoin us November 7\, 2026 
 at Queer Arts Featured in the Castro for an evening of live performance\, 
 original poetry\, and paranda tradition brought to life. Expect original m
 usic and spoken word from South Asian and queer artists\, a close look at 
 the craft of paranda-making\, and a collaborative zine filled with communi
 ty poetry and artwork\, available to take home.\n\nWhether you're returnin
 g for your third Paranda Party or walking in for the first time\, come rea
 dy to celebrate\, be loud\, and be fully yourself.\n\n$60-25\n\nTickets: h
 ttps://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2F200
 2712751752%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/202
 6/11/15/paranda-party-3-jeeti-raho-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34738520/5e524550-83b2-4b72-817e-4852df094c76.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Queer Arts Featured\, 575 Castro Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94
 114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/15/paranda-party-3-jeeti-raho-tick
 ets
END:VEVENT
