SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a vibrant Bachata experience with JAS Latin Dance.
  Whether you are brand new or a seasoned dancer\, the welcoming\, mixed-le
 vel lesson is designed to help everyone learn\, connect\, and have fun.\n\
 n7:00-8:00 PM - Bachata lesson\; beginners welcome and no partner needed.\
