BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“Castro on Fire”: A Queer Resistance Walking Tour by Unspeakab
 le Vice
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T183000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17853534@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:LOCATION\n\nGLBT Historical Society Museum\n\n4127 18th Street
 \n\nSan Francisco\, CA 94114\n\nADMISSION\n\n$35\; Museum admission includ
 ed in tour\n\nRSVP and reserve tickets here\n\nThe GLBT Historical Society
  Museum is pleased to partner with Unspeakable Vice to offer a monthly wal
 king tour focused on the history of LGBTQIA+ resistance in the Castro neig
 hborhood. Created by tour guide\, former senior adjunct professor\, and pr
 acticing designer Shawn Sprockett\, Unspeakable Vice began as a close look
  at the queer origins of San Francisco\, traversing the city’s North Bea
 ch and Barbary Coast areas to trace the history through from 1770-1960. Th
 is new tour closes a three-part story\, extending Sprockett’s detailed a
 nd engaging storytelling to the Castro neighborhood.\n\nTen years after th
 e White Night riots\, the police came back. Meet the trans man doctors tur
 ned away\, the lesbians who ran the blood drives and wards\, and the commu
 nity that answered a plague and two police riots with the same refusal. Th
 is tour includes a free round at the Lookout\, overlooking the neighborhoo
 d you've just walked.\n\nDetails\n\nDuration: about 90 minutes\, plus the 
 round afterward\n\nMeet: GLBT Historical Society\, 4127 18th Street\n\nEnd
 s: the Lookout\, 3600 16th St at Market\n\nTerrain: city sidewalks with on
 e moderate hill\; the Lookout is upstairs\, stairs only\n\nAges: 21+ (free
  round\, one per guest)\n\nHeavy Rain: tours reschedule\; your ticket tran
 sfers\n\nFull route teasers\, the people you'll meet\, and sources: unspea
 kablevice.tour...\n\n$35\, 21+\n\nTickets: https://glbthistory.ticketing.v
 eevartapp.com/tickets/view/list/unspeakable-vice-castro-on-fire-walking-to
 ur-includes-museum-admission\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11
 /21/castro-on-fire-a-queer-resistance-walking-tour-by-unspeakable-vice-tic
 kets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7608609;-122.4356584
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34485257/480cc5fc-c7e1-4185-bd7b-e21536c9f30a.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:GLBT History Museum\, 4127 18th St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/21/castro-on-fire-a-queer-resistan
 ce-walking-tour-by-unspeakable-vice-tickets
END:VEVENT
