 y hour!\n\n🎤 CRAZY KARAOKE THURSDAYS AT THE FUNCTION\nThursdays | 9PM u
 ntil close\nGrab the mic and sing your heart out at San Francisco’s newe
 st karaoke night.\nFree with RSVP – 21+\nWhether you’re a seasoned per
 former\, a shower singer\, or just there to cheer on your friends\, Karaok
 e Thursdays is all about great songs\, great drinks\, and a fun\, welcomin
 g crowd.\n🎵 WHAT TO EXPECT\n• 1000+ songs spanning every genre and er
 a\n• Solo performances\, duets\, and group sing-alongs\n• Big screens\
 , great sound\, and a lively late-night atmosphere\n• Live song requests
  throughout the night\n🛋 UPSTAIRS “NEXT LEVEL” LOUNGE\nNeed a break
  from the spotlight? Head upstairs to the Next Level Lounge for comfortabl
 e seating\, drinks\, and a live feed of the karaoke stage so you won’t m
 iss a thing.\n🍹 DRINK SPECIALS\n• Crazy Hour – $3 shots every hour\
 , on the hour\n🎟 TICKET OPTIONS\nGeneral Admission (Free) – 21+\nGet 
 in free\, add your name to the karaoke list\, grab a drink\, and get ready
  for your moment on stage. Seating is first come\, first served.\nVIP Rock
 star Pass – Fast Track ($10) – 21+\n• Skip the karaoke line and get 
 on stage faster\n• Priority access to performances\n• VIP seating held
  until 10PM\n• Limited availability\nDoors at 9PM. Show up early\, stay 
 late.\nTo help support our bar and wait staff\, there is a two drink minim
 um per person. Shots\, non-alcoholic beverages\, and sodas cou...\n\nFree\
 n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/arcade-karaoke-sfs-wild-new-thurs
 day-party-night-free-tickets-1987841834438?aff=oddtdtcreator&amp\;keep_tld
 =true\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/crazy-karaoke-sfs-wild-new-thursda
 y-night-party-3-shots-sf-8/\nSource: Funcheap SF
