SUMMARY:Dayshift - 30+ Day Party San Francisco
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T190000
DTSTAMP:20261015T212936Z
UID:dothebay-17957429@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:DAYSHIFT is the ultimate daytime dance party for the 30+ crowd
  who still love a proper night out… just not at midnight. From 5–9PM\,
  we transform a room full of strangers into one shared moment—powered by
  the songs you grew up on\, the ones you forgot you loved\, and the ones t
 hat hit instantly. It’s three minutes and you’re 22 again. It’s a fu
 ll room singing the same chorus at the top of their lungs. It’s where re
 al life pauses\, stress disappears\, and nothing matters except the music.
  No egos. Just voices\, energy\, and connection.\nYou’ll be home by 10 b
 ut your voice might be gone by Monday.\nThe soundtrack to your best nights
 … before midnight\nMusic that turns strangers into a crowd—and moments
  into memories\nBuilt on bangers. Powered by nostalgia. Featuring the song
 s you forgot you loved\nConfetti\, CO2 blasts\, hands-in-the-air chaos\, a
 nd singalongs that take over the entire room\nIf you know it\, you’re si
 nging it. If you’re not singing in 5 seconds… we’re playing the wron
 g song\nJust voices. Total strangers… same chorus\nHome by 10PM. Voice g
 one by Monday\nStill not sure what DAYSHIFT is all about? Come experience 
 it for yourself!\n\n21+\; GA $32.25 including $7.25 booking fee\nLOCOMOTIV
 E Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.tixr.com/groups/templesf/events/dayshif
 t-30-day-party-san-francisco-211292\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/
 2026/12/12/dayshift-30-day-party-san-francisco-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879716;-122.3972152
